# Fresh names are numbered in the order calls are expanded, so an
# expansion reads the same every time (MC30).
== SOURCE
"x:" u_se< "Macros"
t := 5
@ x:t_wice< "t + 1"
@ x:t_wice< "t * 2"
== EXPAND
"x:" u_se< "Macros"
t := 5
{ @ -> g1:t := 2; g1:t * (t + 1) } @
{ @ -> g2:t := 2; g2:t * (t * 2) } @
== RESULT
12
20
